"use strict";(self.webpackChunksmartcharts=self.webpackChunksmartcharts||[]).push([[146],{6870(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"-DI":"-DI","[symbol] feed is delayed by [delay] minutes":"[symbol] feed est\xe1 retrasado por [delay] minutos","[symbol] market is now opened.":"el mercado [symbol] est\xe1 ahora abierto.","[symbol] market is presently closed.":"el mercado [symbol] est\xe1 ahora cerrado.","+DI":"+DI","2-Exponential":"2-Exponencial","3-Exponential":"3-Exponencial","A technical momentum indicator that compares a security\'s closing price to its price range over a given time period. The oscillator\'s sensitivity to market movements can be reduced by adjusting the time period or by taking a moving average of the result.":"Un indicador t\xe9cnico momentum que compara el precio de cierre de un valor con su rango de precios en un periodo determinado. La sensibilidad de un oscilador a los movimientos del mercado se puede reducir mediante el ajuste del periodo de tiempo o mediante el uso de una media m\xf3vil del resultado.","Active":"Activo","Add new template":"Agregar nueva plantilla","Add new templates":"Agregar nuevas plantillas","ADX":"ADX","ADX/DMS":"ADX/DMS","All drawings":"Todos los dibujos","Alligator":"Alligator","already exists.":"ya existe.","Apply":"Solicitar","Are you sure?":"\xbfEst\xe1 seguro?","Area":"\xc1rea","Area settings":"Configuraci\xf3n de la zona","Aroon":"Aroon","Aroon Down":"Aroon-down","Aroon Up":"Aroon-up","Available only for \\\\\\"Area\\\\\\" chart type.":"Disponible solo para el tipo de gr\xe1fico \\\\\\"\xc1rea\\\\\\".","Available only for non-tick time intervals.":"Disponible solo para intervalos de tiempo sin tick.","Awesome":"Impresionante","Awesome Oscillator":"Oscilador Awesome","Axis Label":"Etiqueta del eje","Back":"Atr\xe1s","Base Line":"L\xednea Base","Base Line Period":"Per\xedodo de L\xednea Base","Bill Williams introduced the Alligator indicator in 1995. The Alligator is as much a metaphor as it is an indicator. It consists of three lines, overlaid on a pricing chart, that represent the jaw, the teeth and the lips of the beast, and was created to help the trader confirm the presence of a trend and its direction. The Alligator indicator can also help traders designate impulse and corrective wave formations, but the tool works best when combined with a momentum indicator.":"Bill Williams introdujo el indicador Alligator en 1995. El Alligator (cocodrilo en ingl\xe9s) es tanto una met\xe1fora como un indicador. Consiste en tres l\xedneas, superpuestas en una tabla de precios, que representan la mand\xedbula, los dientes y los labios del animal, y fue creado para ayudar al trader a confirmar la presencia de una tendencia y su direcci\xf3n. El indicador Alligator tambi\xe9n puede ayudar a los traders a designar impulsos y formaciones de ondas correctivas, pero la herramienta funciona mejor cuando se combina con un indicador momentum.","Blue":"Azul","Bollinger Bands":"Bandas de Bollinger","Bollinger Bands Bottom":"Bandas de Bollinger Inferiores","Bollinger Bands can be used to measure the highness or lowness of the price relative to previous trades.":"Las Bandas de Bollinger se pueden usar para medir el punto m\xe1s alto o m\xe1s bajo del precio en relaci\xf3n con las transacciones anteriores.","Bollinger Bands Median":"Media de Bandas de Bollinger","Bollinger Bands Top":"Bandas de Bollinger Superiores","Cancel":"Cancelar","Candle":"Vela","CCI":"CCI","Channel Fill":"Relleno del Canal","Chart data is not available for this symbol.":"El gr\xe1fico de datos no est\xe1 disponible para este s\xedmbolo.","Chart type":"Tipo de gr\xe1fico","Chart types":"Tipos de gr\xe1ficos","Charts":"Gr\xe1ficos","Clear all":"Vaciar todo","Click on the chart to confirm point {{step}}.":"Haz clic en el gr\xe1fico para confirmar el punto {{step}}.","Click on the chart to confirm the end point.":"Haz clic en el gr\xe1fico para confirmar el punto final.","Click on the chart to confirm the start point.":"Haz clic en el gr\xe1fico para confirmar el punto de inicio.","Click on the chart to place the line.":"Haz clic en el gr\xe1fico para colocar la l\xednea.","Close":"Cerrar","CLOSED":"CERRADO","Color":"Color","Commodity Channel Index":"\xcdndice de Canal de Materias Primas","Continue":"Continuar","Conversion Line":"L\xednea de Conversi\xf3n","Conversion Line Period":"Per\xedodo de L\xednea de Conversi\xf3n","CSV":"CSV","Dark":"Oscuro","day":"d\xeda","days":"d\xedas","Decreasing Bar":"Barra Decreciente","Default":"Por defecto","Delete":"Eliminar","Detrended":"Detrended","Detrended Price Oscillator":"Oscilador del Precio sin Tendencias","Developed by Larry Williams, Williams %R is a momentum indicator that is the inverse of the Fast Stochastic Oscillator. Also referred to as %R, Williams %R reflects the level of the close relative to the highest high for the look-back period.":"Williams %R es un indicador momentum, desarrollado por Larry Williams, que es el inverso del oscilador estoc\xe1stico r\xe1pido. Tambi\xe9n conocido como %R, Williams %R refleja el nivel del cierre en relaci\xf3n con el valor m\xe1ximo para el per\xedodo retrospectivo.","Developed by Tushar Chande in 1995, Aroon is an indicator system that determines whether a stock is trending or not and how strong the trend is. There are two separate indicators: Aroon-Up and Aroon-Down. A 25-day Aroon-Up measures the number of days since a 25-day high. A 25-day Aroon-Down measures the number of days since a 25-day low.":"Desarrollado por Tushar Chande en 1995, Aroon es un sistema de indicadores que determina si una acci\xf3n est\xe1 en tendencia o no y cu\xe1n fuerte es la tendencia. Hay dos indicadores separados: Aroon-Up y Aroon-Down. Un Aroon-Up de 25 d\xedas mide el n\xfamero de d\xedas desde un m\xe1ximo de 25 d\xedas. Un Aroon-Down de 25 d\xedas mide el n\xfamero de d\xedas desde un m\xednimo de 25 d\xedas.","Disable Crosshair":"Desactivar puntero cruzado","Display data for a specific date and time":"Mostrar datos para una fecha y hora espec\xedficas","Display remaining time for each interval":"Mostrar el tiempo restante para cada intervalo","Display the highest and lowest spot price":"Mostrar el precio spot m\xe1s alto y m\xe1s bajo","Distance(%)":"Distancia(%)","Donchian Channel":"Canal de Donchian","Donchian High":"Donchian Alto","Donchian Low":"Donchian Bajo","Donchian Median":"Donchian Medio","Done":"Finalizado","Double Smoothing Period":"Doble Per\xedodo de Suavizamiento","Download":"Descargar","Download your current chart view as a PNG or export the historical data for analysis as a CSV.":"Descarga la vista actual de tu gr\xe1fico como PNG o exporta los datos hist\xf3ricos para su an\xe1lisis como CSV.","Drawing tools":"Herramientas para dibujar","Enable Crosshair":"Activar puntero cruzado","Exponential":"Exponencial","Fast":"R\xe1pido","Fast MA Period":"Per\xedodo de MA R\xe1pida","Favorites":"Favoritos","Field":"Campo","Fill":"Rellenar","Fill Color":"Color de relleno","Fractal Channel":"Canal de Fractal","Fractal Chaos Band":"Bandas de Caos Fractal","Fractal High":"Fractal Alto","Fractal Low":"Fractal Bajo","Fractals are indicators on candlestick charts that identify reversal points in the market. Traders often use fractals to get an idea about the direction in which the price will develop. A fractal will form when a particular price pattern happens on a chart.":"Los fractales son indicadores en gr\xe1ficos de velas que identifican puntos de reversi\xf3n en el mercado. Los traders a menudo utilizan fractales para tener una idea sobre la direcci\xf3n en la que se desarrollar\xe1 el precio. Un fractal se formar\xe1 cuando un patr\xf3n de precio particular ocurra en un gr\xe1fico.","Gradient":"Gradiente","Green":"Verde","Guide":"Gu\xeda","H":"H","High":"M\xe1ximo","High Period":"Per\xedodo Alto","Highest and lowest spot":"Punto m\xe1s alto y m\xe1s bajo","Histogram":"Histograma","Historical data mode":"Modo de datos hist\xf3ricos","Hl/2":"Hl/2","Hlc/3":"Hlc/3","Hlcc/4":"Hlcc/4","Hollow":"Hueco","Horizontal line [num]":"L\xednea horizontal [num]","hour":"hora","hours":"horas","Hull":"Hull","Ichimoku Clouds":"Nubes Ichimoku","Increasing Bar":"Barra Creciente","Indicators":"Indicadores","Interval duration":"Duraci\xf3n del intervalo","Jaw":"Jaw","Jaw Offset":"Offset de Jaw","Jaw Period":"Per\xedodo Jaw","L":"L","Lagging Span":"L\xednea Retrasada","Lagging Span Period":"Per\xedodo de L\xednea Retrasada","Language":"Idioma","Last digits stats for latest 1000 ticks on":"Estad\xedsticas de los \xfaltimos d\xedgitos para los \xfaltimos 1000 ticks en","Leading Span A":"L\xednea Adelantada A","Leading Span B":"L\xednea Adelantada B","Leading Span B Period":"Per\xedodo de L\xednea Adelantada B","Light":"Claro","Line only":"Solo l\xednea","Line thickness":"Grosor de la l\xednea","Lips":"Labios","Lips Offset":"Desplazamiento de Labios","Lips Period":"Per\xedodo de Labios","Low":"Bajo","Low Period":"Per\xedodo Bajo","MA":"MA","MA Env":"MA Env","MA Env Bottom":"Envoltura MA Inferior","MA Env Median":"Envoltura MA Media","MA Env Top":"Envoltura MA Superior","MACD":"MACD","MACD is a trading indicator used in technical analysis of stock prices. It is supposed to reveal changes in the strength, direction, momentum, and duration of a trend in a stock\'s price.":"El MACD es un indicador burs\xe1til usado en el an\xe1lisis t\xe9cnico de los precios de las acciones. Su objetivo es revelar cambios en la fuerza, direcci\xf3n, momento y duraci\xf3n de una tendencia en el precio de una acci\xf3n.","Markets":"Mercados","Maximum AF":"AF M\xe1ximo","Medium":"Medio","Minimum AF":"AF M\xednimo","minute":"minuto","minutes":"minutos","Momentum":"Momentum","Moving Average (MA)":"Media M\xf3vil (MA)","Moving Average Envelope":"Media M\xf3vil de Envoltura","Moving Average Type":"Tipo de Media M\xf3vil","Moving averages":"Medias m\xf3viles","Negative Bar":"Barra Negativa","Network status":"Estado de la red","No drawing tool added yet":"A\xfan no se ha a\xf1adido ninguna herramienta de dibujo","No indicator added yet":"A\xfan no se ha a\xf1adido ning\xfan indicador","No results for \\\\\\"[text]\\\\\\"":"No se han encontrado resultados para \xab[texto]\xbb","Offset":"Intervalo","OHLC":"OHLC","Ohlc/4":"Ohlc/4","Only selected charts and time intervals are available for this trade type.":"Solo est\xe1n disponibles los gr\xe1ficos e intervalos de tiempo seleccionados para este tipo de operaci\xf3n.","Open":"Abierto","Opens in:":"Abre en:","Orange":"Naranja","Others":"Otros","OverBought":"SobreCompra","OverSold":"SobreVenta","Overwrite":"Sobrescribir","Parabolic SAR":"SAR Parab\xf3lico","Percent":"Porcentaje","Period":"Per\xedodo","Platform settings":"Configuraci\xf3n de la plataforma","PNG":"PNG","Point":"Punto","Positive Bar":"Barra Positiva","Price Rate of Change":"Precio de la Tasa de Cambio","Price ROC":"Precio ROC","PSAR":"PSAR","Purple":"Morado","Rainbow MA":"Arco iris MA","Rainbow Moving Average":"Media M\xf3vil Arco iris","Red":"Rojo","Relative Strength Index (RSI)":"\xcdndice de fuerza relativa (RSI)","removed":"eliminado","Reset":"Restablecer","Retrieving Chart Data...":"Obteniendo Datos del Gr\xe1fico...","Retrieving Chart Engine...":"Obteniendo motor del gr\xe1fico...","Retrieving Market Symbols...":"Obteniendo S\xedmbolos de Mercado...","Retrieving Trading Times...":"Obteniendo Horarios de Trading...","RSI":"IFR","Saved templates":"Plantillas guardadas","Scale to fit data":"Ajustar el tama\xf1o a los datos","Search":"Buscar","Search...":"Buscar...","Select language":"Seleccione el idioma","Select theme":"Seleccione el tema","Series":"Series","Settings":"Configuraci\xf3n","Shading":"Sombreado","Shift":"Cambio","Shift Type":"Tipo de Cambio","Show Fractals":"Mostrar Fractales","Show Lines":"Mostrar l\xedneas","Show Zones":"Mostrar Zonas","Signal":"Se\xf1al","Signal Period":"Per\xedodo de Se\xf1al","Simple":"Sencillo","Size":"Tama\xf1o","Slow":"Lento","Slow MA Period":"Per\xedodo de MA lenta","SMA1":"SMA1","SMA10":"SMA10","SMA2":"SMA2","SMA3":"SMA3","SMA4":"SMA4","SMA5":"SMA5","SMA6":"SMA6","SMA7":"SMA7","SMA8":"SMA8","SMA9":"SMA9","Smooth":"Liso","Smoothing Period":"Per\xedodo de Suavizamiento","Some of your active indicators don’t support 1-tick intervals. If you change to a 1-tick interval, these indicators will be removed from your chart.":"Algunos de sus indicadores activos no admiten intervalos de 1 tick. Si cambia a un intervalo de 1 tick, estos indicadores se eliminar\xe1n de su gr\xe1fico.","Some of your templates may not work with this trade type.":"Es posible que algunas de sus plantillas no funcionen con este tipo de operaci\xf3n.","Standard Deviations":"Desviaciones Est\xe1ndar","Stch Mtm":"Stch Mtm","Stochastic":"Estoc\xe1stico","Stochastic Momentum Index":"\xcdndice de Momento Estoc\xe1stico","Stochastic Oscillator":"Oscilador Estoc\xe1stico","Streaming for [symbol] is not available due to license restrictions":"La transmisi\xf3n de [symbol] no est\xe1 disponible debido a restricciones de licencia","Teeth":"Teeth","Teeth Offset":"Offset de Teeth","Teeth Period":"Per\xedodo de Teeth","Templates":"Plantillas","The Average Directional Movement Index index (ADX) was developed in 1978 by J. Welles Wilder as an indicator of trend strength in a series of prices of a financial instrument ADX will range between 0 and 100. Generally, ADX readings below 20 indicate trend weakness, and readings above 40 indicate trend strength.":"El \xcdndice de Promedio Direccional (ADX) fue desarrollado en 1978 por J. Welles Wilder como un indicador de la fuerza de la tendencia y en una serie de precios de un instrumento financiero ADX oscilar\xe1 entre 0 y 100. En general, las lecturas de ADX por debajo de 20 indican debilidad de la tendencia y las lecturas superiores a 40 indican la fuerza de la tendencia.","The Awesome Oscillator is an indicator used to measure market momentum. AO calculates the difference of a 34 Period and 5 Period Simple Moving Averages. The Simple Moving Averages that are used are not calculated using closing price but rather each bar\'s midpoints. AO is generally used to affirm trends or to anticipate possible reversals.":"El oscilador Awesome es un indicador utilizado para medir el momentum del mercado. AO calcula la diferencia de la Media M\xf3vil Simple de 34 periodos y la de 5 periodos. Las Medias M\xf3viles que se utilizan no se calculan utilizando el precio de cierre, sino los puntos medios de cada barra. AO se usa generalmente para afirmar tendencias o anticipar posibles reversiones.","The Commodity Channel Index (CCI) is a versatile indicator that can be used to identify a new trend or warn of extreme conditions.":"El \xedndice de canal de materias primas (CCI) es un indicador vers\xe1til que se puede utilizar para identificar una nueva tendencia o advertir sobre condiciones extremas.","The Detrended Price Oscillator (DPO) helps to identify price cycles without the influence of short- and long-term trends. The DPO compares a simple moving average to a historical pricenear the middle of a specified period. It also shows the peaks and drops over that particular period, making it easier to predict buy points.":"El Oscilador de Precios sin Tendencia (DPO) ayuda a identificar los ciclos de precios sin la influencia de las tendencias a corto y largo plazo. El DPO compara una media m\xf3vil simple con un precio hist\xf3rico cerca de la mitad de un per\xedodo espec\xedfico. Tambi\xe9n muestra los picos y ca\xeddas durante ese per\xedodo en particular, lo que facilita la predicci\xf3n de puntos de compra.","The Donchian Channel is an indicator used in market trading developed by Richard Donchian. It is formed by taking the highest high and the lowest low of the last n periods. The area between the high and the low is the channel for the period chosen.":"El Canal de Donchian es un indicador utilizado en el comercio de mercado desarrollado por Richard Donchian. Se forma tomando el mayor de los m\xe1ximos y el menor de los m\xednimos de los \xfaltimos n per\xedodos. El \xe1rea entre lo m\xe1ximo y lo m\xednimo es el canal para el per\xedodo elegido.","The Ichimoku Cloud, also known as Ichimoku Kinko Hyo, is a versatile indicator that defines support and resistance, identifies trend direction, gauges momentum and provides trading signals. Ichimoku Kinko Hyo translates into “one look equilibrium chart”.":"La nube Ichimoku, tambi\xe9n conocida como Ichimoku Kinko Hyo, es un indicador vers\xe1til que define el soporte y la resistencia, identifica la direcci\xf3n de la tendencia, mide el momentum y proporciona se\xf1ales de trading. Ichimoku Kinko Hyo se traduce en \\"tabla de equilibrio de una mirada\\".","The Moving Average (MA) helps to identify the overall market trend by filtering out short-term price fluctuations. Using historical data, it calculates the average price over a specific period and plots a line on the chart. If the MA line moves upwards, it’s an indicator of an uptrend, a downtrend if it moves downwards. A buy signal occurs when the price moves above the MA line.":"La Media M\xf3vil (MA) ayuda a identificar la tendencia general del mercado al filtrar las fluctuaciones de precios a corto plazo. Usando datos hist\xf3ricos, calcula el precio promedio durante un per\xedodo espec\xedfico y traza una l\xednea en el gr\xe1fico. Si la l\xednea MA se mueve hacia arriba, es un indicador de una tendencia alcista, o una tendencia bajista si se mueve hacia abajo. Se produce una se\xf1al de compra cuando el precio se mueve por encima de la l\xednea MA.","The Moving Average Envelope (MAE) helps to identify strong price movement that indicates the start of a trend. The MAE creates a moving average line as well as 2 bands around it. In theory, when the market price touches the upper or lower bands, a trend reversal will occur, indicating a buy signal.":"La Envolvente de la Media M\xf3vil (MAE) ayuda a identificar un fuerte movimiento de precios que indica el inicio de una tendencia. El MAE crea una l\xednea de media m\xf3vil y 2 bandas a su alrededor. En teor\xeda, cuando el precio de mercado toca las bandas superior o inferior, se producir\xe1 una inversi\xf3n de tendencia, lo que indica una se\xf1al de compra.","The parabolic SAR is calculated almost independently for each trend in the price. When the price is in an uptrend, the SAR emerges below the price and converges upwards towards it. Similarly, on a downtrend, the SAR emerges above the price and converges downwards. At each step within a trend, the SAR is calculated one period in advance.":"El SAR parab\xf3lico se calcula casi de manera independiente para cada tendencia en el precio. Cuando el precio est\xe1 al alza, el SAR aparece debajo del precio y converge con \xe9l de manera ascendente. De manera similar, en una tendencia bajista, el SAR aparece por encima del precio y converge con \xe9l de manera descendente. En cada paso dentro de una tendencia, el SAR se calcula con un periodo de anticipaci\xf3n.","The Price Rate-of-Change (ROC) indicator displays the difference between the current price and the price x-time periods ago. The difference can be displayed in either points or as a percentage.":"El indicador de tasa de cambio de precio (ROC) muestra la diferencia entre el precio actual y el precio de x per\xedodos atr\xe1s. La diferencia se puede mostrar en puntos o como porcentaje.","The Rainbow Moving Average (RMA) displays several moving average lines simultaneously. When the lines intersect, it’s an indicator of price reversal and the angle of the lines are helpful to predict the trend strength. The steeper the curve, the stronger the trend. When the price crosses the moving average lines from below, it signals an upward trend. When the price crosses the moving average lines from above, it signals a downward trend. The RMA is easier to use compared to using several different moving average indicators at once.":"La Media M\xf3vil Arcoiris (RMA) muestra varias l\xedneas de media m\xf3vil simult\xe1neamente. Cuando las l\xedneas se cruzan, es un indicador de reversi\xf3n de precios y el \xe1ngulo de las l\xedneas es \xfatil para predecir la fuerza de la tendencia. Cuanto m\xe1s empinada es la curva, m\xe1s fuerte es la tendencia. Cuando el precio cruza las l\xedneas de media m\xf3vil desde abajo, indica una tendencia alcista. Cuando el precio cruza las l\xedneas de la media m\xf3vil desde arriba, indica una tendencia bajista. La RMA es m\xe1s f\xe1cil de usar en comparaci\xf3n con el uso de varios indicadores diferentes de media m\xf3vil a la vez.","The Relative Strength Index (RSI) was published by J. Welles Wilder. The current price is normalized as a percentage between 0 and 100. The name of this oscillator is misleading because it does not compare the instrument relative to another instrument or set of instruments, but rather represents the current price relative to other recent prices within the selected lookback window length.":"El \xedndice de fuerza relativa (RSI) fue publicado por J. Welles Wilder. El precio actual se normaliza como un porcentaje entre 0 y 100. El nombre de este oscilador es enga\xf1oso, puesto que no compara el instrumento con relaci\xf3n a otro instrumento o set de instrumentos, sino que representa el precio actual en relaci\xf3n con otros recientes dentro del periodo seleccionado","The Stochastic Momentum Index (SMI) helps to identify overbought or oversold conditions in the market and to predict bearish or bullish trends. It calculates the distance between the current closing price and the median of the high/low range, and displays 2 lines on the chart: the first (known as %K) represents the price movement while the second (known as %D) is a moving average of the first line. If the closing price is higher than the median of the high/low range, the SMI returns a positive value. If the closing price is lower than the average price, a negative value is returned. Values above 40 indicate a bullish trend while values below -40 indicate a bearish trend.":"El \xcdndice de Momentum Estoc\xe1stico (SMI) ayuda a identificar condiciones de sobrecompra o sobreventa en el mercado y predecir tendencias bajistas o alcistas. Calcula la distancia entre el precio de cierre actual y la mediana del rango alto / bajo, y muestra 2 l\xedneas en el gr\xe1fico: la primera (conocida como %K) representa el movimiento del precio, mientras que la segunda (conocida como %D) es un media m\xf3vil de la primera l\xednea. Si el precio de cierre es m\xe1s alto que la mediana del rango alto / bajo, el SMI devuelve un valor positivo. Si el precio de cierre es inferior al precio promedio, se devuelve un valor negativo. Los valores superiores a 40 indican una tendencia alcista, mientras que los valores inferiores a -40 indican una tendencia bajista.","Themes":"Temas","There are no favorites yet.":"No hay favoritos cargados.","Thick":"Grueso","Thin":"Delgado","This indicator does not support 1-tick intervals. To use this indicator, change your chart time interval to 1 minute or more.":"Este indicador no admite intervalos de 1 tick. Para utilizar este indicador, cambie el intervalo de tiempo de su gr\xe1fico a 1 minuto o m\xe1s.","tick":"tick","Time interval":"Intervalo de tiempo","Time Series":"Series temporales","Trend":"Tendencia","Trend line [num]":"L\xednea de tendencia [num]","Triangular":"Triangular","Try checking your spelling or use a different term":"Intente revisar su ortograf\xeda o use un t\xe9rmino diferente","Type":"Tipo","Variable":"Variable","Vertical line [num]":"L\xednea vertical [num]","Volatility":"Volatilidad","Weighted":"Ponderado","Welles Wilder":"Welles Wilder","What is [name]?":"\xbfQu\xe9 es [nombre]?","William\'s %R":"William\'s %R","William\'s Percent Range":"Rango de Porcentaje de Williams","Would you like to overwrite it?":"\xbfDesea sobrescribirlo?","You can add up to [count] indicators.":"Puede a\xf1adir hasta [count] indicadores.","You have no saved templates yet.":"A\xfan no tiene plantillas guardadas.","Zero Lag":"Retraso cero","Zig Zag":"Zig Zag","Zig Zag helps to identify trend reversals and filters out relatively small price movements by determining the support and resistance levels of the market. It accepts a percentage of deviation as the input and displays a line if the price change is larger than the percentage of deviation. Zig Zag ignores any sideways movement and is useful to filter out “market noise”.":"Zig Zag ayuda a identificar cambios de tendencia y filtra movimientos de precios relativamente peque\xf1os al determinar los niveles de soporte y resistencia del mercado. Acepta un porcentaje de desviaci\xf3n como entrada y muestra una l\xednea si el cambio de precio es mayor que el porcentaje de desviaci\xf3n. Zig Zag ignora cualquier movimiento lateral y es \xfatil para filtrar el \\"ruido del mercado\\".","Zoom in":"Acercar","Zoom out":"Alejar"}')}}]);